positions.description:
As a Senior Developer, I helped Jobnimbus to push forward multiple projects: 
(1) a Microfrontend/Microservice focused on improving the estimation experience for the customers (using DDD approach, and React-Redux/ASP.NET/Postgre core as tech stack); 
(2) As the technical lead in the integration of an existing communication software inside the main SaaS product (participated in the architectural decision, as well as help on the implementation side. Tech Stack: PHP, Vanilla JS with Jquery, SingleSPA, React);
(3) As a technical lead in the integration of a 3rd party reporting software (Qrvey) to the JobNimbus platform. I helped with building pipelines for data ingestion (using AWS Kinesis, Lambdas -with Typescript-), frontend integration (via SingleSPA/React), and backend support (via AWS Lambdas, Secrets). Also, I developed improvements over the existing data pipeline using Step Functions/Athena/Glue Job-PySpark.
In addition to the main development work on the previous projects, I helped on developing the CI/CD pipelines, using Terraform/Jenkins/Github Actions, as well as writing e2e tests when necessary (using Pytest/Selenium).

